WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.842
Starting injectable therapy in type 2 diabetes.

2
00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:08.495
When to start, how to explain it to patients and how to follow up in the first weeks.

3
00:00:08.945 --> 00:00:16.131
Some glucose-lowering classes reduce cardiovascular events and slow kidney disease, independent of their effect on glucose.

4
00:00:16.581 --> 00:00:20.598
Weight management is central to treatment and can lead to remission in some patients.

5
00:00:21.048 --> 00:00:26.575
Eyes, feet, kidneys and cardiovascular risk should be reviewed at least once a year.
